      "rationale": "Lists only the rendered [data-tree-node] rows in displayed order, with each occurrence and a real-change predicate that excludes unknown and unchanged. It does not list roster continuation controls or inspect unreturned-member counts.",
      "role": "support"
    },
    {
      "anchor": {
        "blob": "3f4f48e8b7fc8fbe3e202d423976d38219d30c6b",
